      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790872378553,
      "created": 1790872359696,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Crypto-shredding:\n    DEK\n    KEK",
      "fontSize": 19.37012139335456,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Crypto-shredding:\n    DEK\n    KEK",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "lCg4nHvPtibOtTfy745jC",
      "type": "image",
      "x": -2538.715084278363,
      "y": 1696.9089974292813,
      "width": 1568.8420003602632,
      "height": 721.6673201657211,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "transparent",
      "backgroundColor": "#e9ecef",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0t",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 141037907,
      "version": 131,
      "versionNonce": 1977556563,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790877044230,
      "created": 1790877027086,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "status": "saved",
      "fileId": "24b86758bd1a4ad3138d23a6d13ba61949c24368",
      "scale": [
        1,
        1
      ],
      "crop": null
    },
    {
      "id": "4HGtEQlJmC4GosRtuQZ6k",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 333.6368699774939,
      "y": 3026.589124910755,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 300,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#e9ecef",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0u",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 441076886,
      "version": 166,
      "versionNonce": 1069617802,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791105056054,
      "created": 1791103461282,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "At rest, the POC uses envelope encryption. Each flight receives a random DEK,\neach biometric template is encrypted with that DEK, and the DEK is stored only\nafter being wrapped by a KEK from a local PKCS12 keystore. Templates are\ndecrypted only in memory during matching and are not cached in plaintext. After\ndeparture and a grace period, one transaction deletes the gallery, removes the\nwrapped DEK, marks the flight purged, and writes an audit event.\nThe limitation is that a pre-purge database backup still contains the wrapped\nDEK, so production would manage per-flight keys and their deletion through a\nKMS or HSM with coordinated backup retention.\nFor data in transit, the current local POC uses localhost HTTP and does not\nimplement TLS. Production would require HTTPS at the gate, mTLS between\nservices, and verified TLS connections to the database.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "At rest, the POC uses envelope encryption. Each flight receives a random DEK, each biometric template is encrypted with that DEK, and the DEK is stored only after being wrapped by a KEK from a local PKCS12 keystore. Templates are decrypted only in memory during matching and are not cached in plaintext. After departure and a grace period, one transaction deletes the gallery, removes the wrapped DEK, marks the flight purged, and writes an audit event.\nThe limitation is that a pre-purge database backup still contains the wrapped DEK, so production would manage per-flight keys and their deletion through a KMS or HSM with coordinated backup retention.\nFor data in transit, the current local POC uses localhost HTTP and does not implement TLS. Production would require HTTPS at the gate, mTLS between services, and verified TLS connections to the database.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
