      "seed": 1017817354,
      "version": 267,
      "versionNonce": 766847370,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791105056054,
      "created": 1791103782333,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "DEK  Data Encryption Key: encrypts and decrypts the actual biometric\nembeddings.\nKEK  Key Encryption Key: encrypts, or “wraps,” the DEK.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "DEK  Data Encryption Key: encrypts and decrypts the actual biometric embeddings.\nKEK  Key Encryption Key: encrypts, or “wraps,” the DEK.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "lbtMSJyBHkcds8-F8Hc4y",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -11.764999241355554,
      "y": 2421.8041043288135,
      "width": 348.2197570800781,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#e9ecef",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1Q",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1082622986,
      "version": 444,
      "versionNonce": 1294690378,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791105056054,
      "created": 1791103801717,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\nDEK\n        ↓ wrapped with KEK\nWrapped DEK stored in PostgreSQL",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\nDEK\n        ↓ wrapped with KEK\nWrapped DEK stored in PostgreSQL",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "rIwwCXR2DF4hfEtSaTBMM",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 347.57676365083285,
      "y": 2824.4593832838987,
      "width": 422.3796691894531,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#e9ecef",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1R",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 104392330,
      "version": 145,
      "versionNonce": 149671690,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791105056054,
      "created": 1791103841443,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Biometric embedding\n        ↓ encrypted with DEK\nEncrypted embedding stored in PostgreSQL\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Biometric embedding\n        ↓ encrypted with DEK\nEncrypted embedding stored in PostgreSQL\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "3encCVFHTCVFJvHj6XKHk",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1238.8308415167096,
      "y": 952.1391109485568,
      "width": 1255.449729280681,
      "height": 525,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#e9ecef",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1S",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 506751370,
      "version": 432,
      "versionNonce": 994735766,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791105059133,
      "created": 1791105001376,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The model service supports two model pipelines:\nPipeline        Face detection        Face embedding             Difference\nPrimary        SCRFD-10G        ArcFace R50 buffalo_l        More capable but heavier; preferred for the POC\nFallback        YuNet                           SFace                Lighter and easier to run through OpenCV\n\n\nImage\n  ↓\nDetector finds and aligns the face\n  ↓\nEmbedding model converts the face into a numeric vector\n\nThe model service returns:\nface count + model ID + embedding\n\nIt does not identify the passenger or make the boarding decision.\nEach pipeline has its own scoring behavior, so embeddings and thresholds cannot be mixed:\n- ArcFace R50 threshold: 0.44 in this POC\n- SFace threshold: 0.363\nThe R50 threshold came from limited POC analysis. The SFace value is the OpenCV default and was not independently\ncalibrated here",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The model service supports two model pipelines:\nPipeline        Face detection        Face embedding             Difference\nPrimary        SCRFD-10G        ArcFace R50 buffalo_l        More capable but heavier; preferred for the POC\nFallback        YuNet                           SFace                Lighter and easier to run through OpenCV\n\n\nImage\n  ↓\nDetector finds and aligns the face\n  ↓\nEmbedding model converts the face into a numeric vector\n\nThe model service returns:\nface count + model ID + embedding\n\nIt does not identify the passenger or make the boarding decision.\nEach pipeline has its own scoring behavior, so embeddings and thresholds cannot be mixed:\n- ArcFace R50 threshold: 0.44 in this POC\n- SFace threshold: 0.363\nThe R50 threshold came from limited POC analysis. The SFace value is the OpenCV default and was not independently calibrated here",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    }
  ],
